menu "Radio controller UART"

config RADIO_CONTROLLER_UART_RX_GPIO
    int "Radio ESP UART RX GPIO"
    range 0 48
    default 40
    help
        Receives controller GPIO6 (TX). GPIO40 is free on the ESP32-S3 N16R8
        radio board configuration.

config RADIO_CONTROLLER_UART_TX_GPIO
    int "Radio ESP UART TX GPIO"
    range 0 48
    default 41
    help
        Transmits to controller GPIO5 (RX). GPIO41 is free on the ESP32-S3
        N16R8 radio board configuration.

config RADIO_CONTROLLER_AUDIO_RDY_GPIO
    int "Radio ESP AUDIO_RDY GPIO"
    range 0 48
    default 42
    help
        Active-high output to the controller. It remains low during application
        initialization and rises after idle service is ready and the initial
        UART status snapshot has been transmitted.

endmenu